 =E2=80=9Cyes=E2=80=9D too often is one of the fastest ways to slow down re=
al progress.<br><br>Not every opportunity aligns with your vision. Not ever=
y request respects your time. Not every partnership adds value to your ecos=
ystem.<br><br>In the early days, I was chasing everything. I wanted to grow=
